job execution service with clear ownership semantics and a minimal but extensible API surface.\r\n\r\n## Design highlights\r\n- gRPC-based API for strongly typed contracts and clear client/server boundaries\r\n- Explicit job ownership model (caller becomes owner)\r\n- Simple lifecycle model (start → running → finished/failed)\r\n\r\n## Review focus\r\n- API shape and naming (RPC semantics)\r\n- Job ownership and access model\r\n- Lifecycle/state modeling\r\n- Any missing edge cases or incorrect assumptions\r\n\r\n## Out of scope (for this PR)\r\n- Implementation of the worker service\r\n- Advanced RBAC or multi-tenant isolation\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- Verified `protoc --go_out=. --go-grpc_out=. worker.proto` successfully generates code","closed_by":{"login":"MarkDHarris","id":11096525,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDk2NTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11096525?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkDHarris","html_url":"https://github.com/MarkDHarris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkDHarris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkDHarris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkDHarris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkDHarris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkDHarris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkDHarris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkDHarris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkDHarris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarkDHarris/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarkDHarris/teleport-systems-challenge/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarkDHarris/teleport-sys